{"name":"Culpeo","hex":"#e69b3a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"culpeo","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A canid of species (Lycalopex culpaeus), native to the Andes region of South America."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/culpeo"}],"entries":[{"title":"Culpeo","blocks":[{"text":"The culpeo, also known as Culpeo zorro, Andean zorro, Andean fox, Paramo wolf, Andean wolf, and colpeo fox, is a species of South American fox. Despite the name, it is not in the Vulpes, but more closely related to wolves and jackals. Its appearance resembles that of foxes due to convergent evolution."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Culpeo_%28Lycalopex_culpaeus_culpaeus%29_Lo_Barnechea_2.jpg/330px-Culpeo_%28Lycalopex_culpaeus_culpaeus%29_Lo_Barnechea_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Culpeo"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/Culpeo_area.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/Culpeo_area.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACulpeo_area.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/74/Culpeoskull.jpg/330px-Culpeoskull.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/74/Culpeoskull.jpg/330px-Culpeoskull.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Culpeo skull","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACulpeoskull.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/Distribution_of_culpeo%27s_subspecies.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.or